# Kubeflow Model Registry Response Invalid

This monitor detects an invalid Model Registry response from [{{labels.service_name}}](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}).

Compare the metric and threshold in this monitor's chart at the time of the alert.

Triage:

1. Fetch `/api/model_registry/v1alpha3/registered_models` with the same Authorization header as the collector.
2. Confirm the response is JSON and contains the top-level `items` collection expected by this deployed API version.
3. Check for an ingress login page, proxy error body, or API-version mismatch returned with HTTP 200.
4. Update the endpoint or validation only after verifying the deployed Model Registry API contract.
